flowchart TD
    %% what the rmcp start-up loop does with the first messages
    first[First client message] --> kind{What is it?}
    kind -->|initialize| legacy[Legacy session]
    kind -->|server/discover| discover[Answer from the start-up loop]
    discover --> first
    kind -->|"complete modern request"| modern[Modern lifecycle, latch armed]
    kind -->|notification| fail[ExpectedInitializeRequest: session ends]
    kind -->|"ping"| pong["Answer {}"]
    pong --> first
